E=[('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 37, 'and that it must give life.', 'and that it must lead to communion.'), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 53, 'Prudence is what makes the four pull together, in this moment, toward the good of this person.', 'Prudence is what makes the four pull together, in this moment, toward communion with this person and with God.'), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 87, 'all four are present in the single motion of love.', 'all four are present in the single motion of love. And all of it happens inside a bond the boy could not break: he is still a son, and the feast is communion restored.'), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 105, 'the single integrated act in which truth, justice, mercy and sacrifice are all present at once.', 'the single integrated act in which every facet of love is present at once: the sacred bond of covenant, truth, justice, mercy and sacrifice held together, and the communion they lead to.'), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 134, 'This is where the four-as-one we spoke of earlier', 'This is where the oneness of love we spoke of earlier'), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 138, "from first to last it is only love's truth, justice, mercy and sacrifice, brought to bear on one real and particular life.", 'from first to last it is only love itself, the sacred gift of covenant with all its facets, brought to bear on one real and particular life.'), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 188, 'It honors truth, for his life is still his life;', "It honors what is sacred, for his life is God's gift; truth, for his life is still his life;"), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 188, "and sacrifice, for it pours out one's own time, sleep, and comfort.", "and sacrifice, for it pours out one's own time, sleep, and comfort. And it keeps faith with the covenant between parent and child, a communion that does not end when his usefulness does."), ('Redline 4 · every facet where the chapter sums up love', 232, 'every part binds truth, justice, mercy and sacrifice together.', 'every part binds truth, justice, mercy and sacrifice into communion.')]
